{
  "key": 62547,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_LetsTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I’m glad to see\n",
        "you here.\r",
        "If you don’t mind, let’s team up.\n",
        "The Pokémon seem to be restless.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Content de te voir ici,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Faisons équipe, les Pokémon ont l’air\n",
        "agités ici.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_DecidedToGoWithRiley",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} decided to go with\n",
        "Riley!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} décide d’accompagner \n",
        "Armand!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_IllHealYourPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: If your Pokémon get hurt,\n",
        "I’ll heal them up."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Si tes Pokémon se font \n",
        "blesser, je les soignerai."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_HiLetsTeamUp",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Let’s team up.\f",
        "The Pokémon seem to be restless.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Salut, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Faisons équipe, d’accord?\f",
        "Les Pokémon sont agités par ici.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_GoodIfYouCameBack",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: ...Are you going back?\r",
        "I’ll be hanging around here.\n",
        "It would be good if you came back.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Tu fais demi-tour?\r",
        "Je vais rester dans le coin en \n",
        "attendant ton retour. Ne m’oublie pas!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_YoureResponsible",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: I get it now. You’re\n",
        "responsible for agitating the Pokémon.\r",
        "I don’t care what good reason you may\n",
        "have, but I don’t want you bringing\f",
        "any trouble into the mine.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Je comprends maintenant. \n",
        "Si les Pokémon sont agités,\f",
        "c’est à cause de vous!\r",
        "Je me fiche des raisons de votre \n",
        "présence ici, je veux juste que\f",
        "vous laissiez ma mine tranquille!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_WellTakeAllPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: We’re Team Galactic!\n",
        "We’ll take all the Pokémon we want!\f",
        "Isn’t that right, partner?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sbire 1: Nous sommes la Team Galaxie!\n",
        "On peut prendre tous les Pokémon qu’on\f",
        "veut! Pas vrai, partenaire?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_WereAbductingPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: You said it, brother!\n",
        "So that’s what we’re gonna do!\r",
        "We’re abducting all the Pokémon from\n",
        "this rusted-out Iron Island!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sbire 2: Et comment qu’on peut!\n",
        "Et c’est bien ce qu’on va faire!\r",
        "Tous les Pokémon de cette vieille \n",
        "Ile de Fer rouillée sont à nous!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_WeCantLose",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: To share in all the joys and\n",
        "all the sorrows...\r",
        "That is how all the Trainers and\n",
        "Pokémon live in Sinnoh!\r",
        "I won’t allow anyone to defy that\n",
        "code of ethics!\r",
        "Come on, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "This is one battle we can’t lose!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Ensemble, dans la joie \n",
        "comme dans la peine...\r",
        "Voilà comment vivent les Pokémon \n",
        "et les Dresseurs de Sinnoh!\r",
        "Je ne vous laisserai pas \n",
        "piétiner ce grand principe!\r",
        "Avec moi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Donnons-leur une leçon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_LetsBeatItPartner",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: Stop! I said stop!\n",
        "Your combination is so sick!\f",
        "The both of you, and your Pokémon...\r",
        "Let’s beat it, partner!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sbire 1: Stop! Pitié!\n",
        "Votre équipe est trop forte!\f",
        "Vous deux et vos Pokémon...\r",
        "On se tire, partenaire!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_WeDontKnowBigPlan",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: You said it, brother!\r",
        "We don’t even know what Team \n",
        "Galactic’s big plan is anyway!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sbire 2: Ouais, et vite!\r",
        "On sait rien des plans de la \n",
        "Team Galaxie de toute façon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_WouldYouTakeEgg",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: Thanks.\n",
        "You really helped me out.\r",
        "Listen, I have a Pokémon Egg\n",
        "here.\r",
        "Would you take it with you?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Je te dois une fière chandelle.\r",
        "Ecoute, j’ai un Oeuf de Pokémon ici.\n",
        "Tu voudrais bien le prendre avec toi?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_ShowEggPokemonPlaces",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: Thanks!\r",
        "I’d like you to show the Pokémon\n",
        "that’s inside the Egg all sorts\f",
        "of new places.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Super!\r",
        "Je voudrais que tu fasses découvrir le \n",
        "monde au Pokémon qui sortira de cet\f",
        "Oeuf. Occupe-toi bien de lui.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_NoRoomToTakeEgg",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: Thank you...\r",
        "But you don’t have room to take\n",
        "another Pokémon.\r",
        "All right, then.\n",
        "I’ll wait here for you."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: C’est gentil mais...\r",
        "Tu n’as plus assez de place \n",
        "pour un autre Pokémon.\r",
        "C’est pas grave, je vais t’attendre ici."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_AcceptItAsToken",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: I hope you’ll accept it as\n",
        "a token of our friendship.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: J’aurais espéré que tu \n",
        "acceptes, en gage de notre amitié...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_LetsMeetAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: Spending time with you was\n",
        "very enjoyable.\r",
        "I intend to test my skills in other\n",
        "places from now on.\r",
        "Let’s meet again!\n",
        "Take care on the way out."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: On a bien assuré tous les deux.\r",
        "Mais je voudrais voir du pays.\r",
        "On se reverra peut-être! Fais \n",
        "attention à toi sur le chemin du retour."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_Dummy16",
      "garbage": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_Dummy17",
      "garbage": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_IdAgree",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: Haha, I’d have to agree.\r",
        "People training here would be those\n",
        "with too much time on their hands."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Ha, ha, je suis bien d’accord.\r",
        "Les gens qui s’entraînent ici \n",
        "ont vraiment du temps à perdre."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_SteelOresPlayedOut",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: This used to be a fairly\n",
        "thriving ore mine once upon a time.\r",
        "I guess the steel ore’s played out.\n",
        "There’s only Pokémon here now."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Il y avait une mine très \n",
        "importante ici il y a longtemps.\r",
        "Les ressources ont dû finir par \n",
        "s’épuiser. Il ne reste que des Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_HaveYouMetByron",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: Have you met Byron?\n",
        "The Leader of Canalave Gym?\r",
        "He’s asked me to become a Gym Leader,\n",
        "but there’s his son Roark to consider."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Tu as déjà rencontré Charles?\n",
        "Le Champion de l’Arène de Joliberges?\r",
        "Il m’a demandé de devenir Champion \n",
        "d’Arène, mais son fils Pierrick\f",
        "est aussi bien placé pour le poste."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_ImagineSteelVsSteel",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: Imagine what it would be like\n",
        "for a Steel-type Pokémon user to\f",
        "battle a Steel type.\r",
        "Would that be like battling yourself,\n",
        "I wonder?\r",
        "I mean, it’s a lot harder to defeat\n",
        "one’s self than anyone else."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Imagine un combat entre \n",
        "deux Dresseurs qui utilisent des\f",
        "Pokémon de type Acier.\r",
        "Est-ce que ça serait un peu comme \n",
        "combattre contre soi-même?\r",
        "Je veux dire, c’est toujours plus \n",
        "difficile de se vaincre soi-même."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIslandB2FLeftRoom_Text_WhatsGoingOnHere",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: What’s going on here, though?\n",
        "The native Pokémon are restless...\r",
        "I don’t like this...\n",
        "Let’s hurry."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Armand: Il se passe quelque chose.\n",
        "Les Pokémon semblent agités...\r",
        "Je n’aime pas ça... Dépêchons-nous."
      ]
    }
  ]
}